{"id":"wb-5-506","name":"桂园","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"桂园","text":"桂园位于中华人民共和国重庆市渝中区中山四路65号，是原中华民国国军上将张治中的公馆，因院内有两株桂树而得名。1945年8月重庆谈判期间，桂园成为毛泽东与周恩来等人代表中国共产党同国民政府代表进行谈判和签订《政府与中共代表会谈纪要》（即双十协定）的地点。现为红岩革命纪念馆桂园展览室。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E6%A1%82%E5%9B%AD","revisionId":94034251,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=94034251","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与地理坐标一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/55102e330fcf688269197db5.jpg","title":"Guiyuan_Entrance.jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Guiyuan_Entrance.jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/0/01/Guiyuan_Entrance.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"Junyi Lou","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0","caption":"​桂园入口牌","width":320,"height":240}}